OL,3,GNEWSA'Hosepipe ban' and 'Britain's
OL,4,Afavourite path'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHere's our weekly roundup of stories
OL,7,Ffrom across local websites in the West
OL,8,Fof England.
OL,10,FMore than a million people in Bristol
OL,11,Fand the surrounding area who are
OL,12,Fsupplied with drinking water by Bristol
OL,13,FWater are now under a hose pipe ban for
OL,14,Fthe first time in 50 years following
OL,15,Fthe months-long drought.
OL,17,FA mum and her two children lost all of
OL,18,Ftheir belongings after their home in
OL,19,FTredworth caught fire. Gloucestershire
OL,20,FLive said a fire started in their
OL,21,Fgarden and quickly spread during the
OL,22,Ffifth heatwave of the summer.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
