OL,3,GNEWSA'Hosepipe ban' and 'Britain's
OL,4,Afavourite path'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth West Ambulance Service paid
OL,7,Ftribute to one of their longest-serving
OL,8,Fmembers of staff, who joined as an
OL,9,F"ambulance man" before paramedics
OL,10,Fexisted. Roland "Roly" Revell has
OL,11,Fserved in ambulances in Salisbury for
OL,12,F50 years and has just retired.
